**/bin
**/obj
**/storage
**/uploads
**/*.log
# Never bake local dev appsettings (real OAuth/FASHN secrets) into the image.
# Production config comes from environment variables / compose only. Mirrors the
# repo-root .dockerignore: that one only covers builds with the repo root as
# context (frontend image); this backend build context needs its own copy.
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
